      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "住进去的人，很多再也没有走出来，也没人问起。",
      "sha256": "f077b37fabad72692e9f0320e55045f1cfb66bed5e474bb3438d6838e7f98429",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 5,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "他本名赫尔曼·马吉特，1861年生在新罕布什尔州。",
      "sha256": "a3ac372021c3e4200e7585936b1b18cc6bc6840c43e630e90d2767f1d2bf2c63",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "聪明、善谈，在密歇根大学学医；据说那时就开始用尸体骗保险。",
      "sha256": "04df632059a70c62cf16336599a5d6768e8c718c539e0447c041c3a904beb1ed",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "一份保险单，一枚红印章，他靠这套把戏骗过钱。",
      "sha256": "c16dfceec216dca676eae6db33aa9567efac23eadf83123ef79c2e357a1d343e",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "后来他改名霍姆斯，搬到芝加哥，准备大干一场。",
      "sha256": "9b68456c4ef6e234d436d928394185372de0a45f8f91ac48788101b25f51e796",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "1886年，他来到芝加哥，接手了英格尔伍德街角的一家药店。",
      "sha256": "e2b1c87a047029282bcfa146179571078c61f7e90f2415496a3e5145a8af0037",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "又在对面盖起一栋三层大楼，取名“世界博览会旅馆”。",
      "sha256": "11cd2b84fa3053ec67dd0caf4860c3092a70b9d0afe3e7b09809fe82f0713bef",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "传说，楼里有暗道、活板门，还有没有窗户的房间。",
      "sha256": "74194f62e5df00d0a8038e377c13b14c6e03dd01753e75230f37a11657fa66d9",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "他不断换工人，一批走了又来，没人知道大楼全貌。",
      "sha256": "10513b7564ca66c71b3b2a5894bb0a214787900257181f2e922eaeca6a07530a",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "1893年世博会期间，全城挤满外地游客，失踪几个人没人注意。",
      "sha256": "a14450e309773b4b3543e763ce1d205501b795c0b59ebdbc1f8601e9df54596d",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "传说，独自来游览的年轻女子，进了那栋楼，再没消息。",
      "sha256": "680eee8ab54040491835fa4c536e27805f117e550d84e44c68cb71c4edebfa0e",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 67,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "报纸一篇接一篇地渲染，数字越写越大，两百、三百。",
      "sha256": "4fa5d362d7f1739d220b2148a891426ce4f40a85b66f0030a35e9d5dbb37c51c",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 74,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "杀人城堡的传说，就这样诞生了。",
      "sha256": "6d1348e97fa1d8a2aab2239b36bcbbba70ffaf7578c6034421fa4a6f1550d21b",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 80,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "但真相比传说更冷：他杀的多半不是游客，而是身边的熟人。",
      "sha256": "b227fa5ea4d1dfbc002c1e2eca451d7930572482f80708c4304978c6e636c452",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 85,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "1894年，他和皮泰泽尔假死骗保，一万美元。",
      "sha256": "46d9b883df54d345143600978d6bba4d3c32d6f8a48d269ebd7b3d28da8b2027",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 91,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "可他半路改了主意：皮泰泽尔死了，保险金归了他。",
      "sha256": "cfaac446efe819cce5723575d093f1e63c28e591085cb0ba3b6084489019116a",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 97,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "让他败露的不是那座楼，而是保险诈骗。",
      "sha256": "63f0aae6b999e5cb67d19f391bbf16797a9d3e648a9d6d0fcf64b7b224fce933",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 103,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "他骗皮泰泽尔的妻子，说带三个孩子坐火车，去见父亲。",
      "sha256": "f19d0b4e1b43139d4253f49b01d76c9f466863cae6cef4ef547872f9928a17dd",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 108,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "三个孩子：艾丽斯十五岁，内莉十一，霍华德才八岁。",
      "sha256": "be3bf2e7d96ae358c6e8c0dbe1204d0ab514772596787ba742dcf54b7bf4f81f",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 114,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "在多伦多，内莉和霍华德跟着他进了地窖门。",
      "sha256": "b7f490c46136247420e4b6d912da1ed5fd4d8becefbda27ee9bee630d8441159",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 120,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "印第安纳波利斯，艾丽斯只留下一只小鞋。",
      "sha256": "64b9e2fe33f8c205a31c676e8d69ca67666c2f459ab453c8b9f2993484465461",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 125,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "费城侦探弗兰克·盖耶盯着地图，一个城市一个城市地划线。",
      "sha256": "e9299fa0c2afcddd2781c2442c1af63775b22853ae85ea9fff2fa9abe782e1ee",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 130,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "他沿着铁路追下去，车站、旅馆、码头，一路问过去。",
      "sha256": "fc474db673dcb1679015a2eeb13da25949b52fce4cd09464f133c040a713eacd",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 137,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "在多伦多的地窖，他撬开箱子，认出两个孩子的衣物。",
      "sha256": "f4b011bff23b77301e6cf8bd8ba018509c35facaaaa10e4a649a78f8ba6b081c",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 144,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "1895年，他承认杀了二十七个人，可其中有人还活着。",
      "sha256": "98c6a77688a973061f1ff64532562690c56523b29d57ab06bddfe3a351b042ed",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 150,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
      "text": "法庭只以谋杀皮泰泽尔一案，判他死刑。",
      "sha256": "f377ec81855bed8eb082433183410bfcf586ee78fd7f674bedef57b268e697ae",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 156,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "file": "S28.mp3",
      "text": "1896年5月7日，他在莫亚门辛监狱被执行死刑。",
      "sha256": "c0c517d7d6157bdb7341e0fb6f1ac29d890f929567319ac84f086e0dd205a8ec",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 162,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "file": "S29.mp3",
      "text": "他要了一口木棺，还要求用水泥把它封死。",
      "sha256": "2d726476ea18f793f27fab39b23d005cf3681260512f26998a64bed16173aaab",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
